  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLOSED- Independent Evaluation of Frontier Technologies Livestreaming- ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are seeking an Evaluation Supplier to conduct an evaluation of Frontier Tech Livestreaming, part of the Ideas to Impact (I2I) programme, on the terms set out in this document. This Terms of Reference provides an overview of the I2I programme, since its inception in 2014, as well as a statement of the evaluation requirements including deliverables and timeframes. The main benefits and challenges of the Livestreaming component will be explored to identify lessons and implications for a potential follow-on programme.</narrative>
  </description>
